      "cooked": "<p>Who here is also on Board Game Geek?  Ok, better question, who ISN’T on Board Game Geek?</p>\n<p>They are having a bit of a contest for “Most Anticipated Games of 2012” and Rook City is <span class=\"hashtag\">#1</span> in its category!  Not sure why we were listed in the “cooperative” or the “expansion” categories, but I say we take this shot and go for number 1!  Get some much deserved attention for Rook City!  Go check it out: <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/98808/polls-20-most-anticipated-games-of-2012-final\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/98808/polls-20-most-anticipated-games-of-2012-final</a></p>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>",
