      "raw": "Who here is also on Board Game Geek?  Ok, better question, who ISN'T on Board Game Geek?  \n\nThey are having a bit of a contest for \"Most Anticipated Games of 2012\" and Rook City is #1 in its category!  Not sure why we were listed in the \"cooperative\" or the \"expansion\" categories, but I say we take this shot and go for number 1!  Get some much deserved attention for Rook City!  Go check it out: [url=http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/98808/polls-20-most-anticipated-games-of-2012-final]http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/98808/polls-20-most-anticipated-games-of-2012-final[/url]\n\nEnjoy!",
